<title>USA: Iomega Corp zip drive shipments pass 6 mln.</title>
<headline>Iomega Corp zip drive shipments pass 6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ROY, Utah 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iomega Corp said on Monday that global shipments of its Zip drive storage product passed six million in May.</p>
<p>In a separate news release, Iomega said that Sony Information Technologies of America, a unit of Sony Corp, will include the Zip drive as a standard feature in its PCV-130 and PCV-150 computers.</p>
<p>The computers will be available at U.S. retail outlets in July.</p>
<p>Iomega shares were up 3/4 to 18-1/8 in late-afternoon trading.</p>
</text>
